@startuml SD-03
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-03 / UC-03 - Browse and find books
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Customer as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Browse with optional keyword, category and price order
note right of system
Trim keyword; search title OR author, then
apply category. Return listed titles only;
include zero-stock titles.
end note
alt matches exist
system --> actor: Show matching titles, authors, prices and availability
else no matches
system --> actor: Show an explicit no-results message
else read fails
system --> actor: Show read error; do not present failure as an empty\ncatalogue
end
opt customer selects a title
actor -> system: Open selected book details
alt book exists and remains listed
system --> actor: Show details; mark zero stock unavailable for reservation
else missing or unlisted
system --> actor: Show unavailable message and route back to catalogue
end
end
@enduml
